{"kode":"TYRE","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000004064","email":["corsec@kingland.co.id"],"fax":"62-254 400268","npwp":"31.229.435.8-401.000","phone":" 62-254 402675","website":"www.kingland.co.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2023-05-08T02:00:48+07:00","value":"","office":"Jalan Raya Serang KM. 68,\nDesa Nambo Ilir, Kecamatan Kibin,\nKabupaten Serang, Banten 42185"}],"background":"Perseroan pertama kali mulai beroperasi pada Agustus 2010 dan berkedudukan serta memiliki pabrik yang berada di Jl. Raya Serang Km 68, Kabupaten Serang, Provinsi Banten.\n\nPerseroan dan Perusahaan Anak selanjutnya disebut Grup Perseroan bergerak dalam bidang industri ban dan telah beroperasi sejak tahun 1977. Pada awalnya Grup Perseroan memproduksi ban dalam untuk sepeda, sepeda motor, mobil dan truk dengan merek dagang Kingland dan pada tahun 2010 Grup Perseroan juga melebarkan bisnisnya dengan didirikannya Perseroan untuk memproduksi ban luar untuk sepeda motor. Dalam perjalannya, Perseroan telah mendistribusikan produk Perseroan ke seluruh provinsi di Indonesia melalui jaringan distributor. Perseroan juga telah menjadi salah satu supplier ban Original Equipment Manufacture (OEM) Ban Luar kendaraan bermotor dan sepeda di Indonesia. Dalam menjalankan bisnisnya, Perseroan menerapkan Quality Management System SNI ISO 9001:2015,  dan Sertifikat Mutu E4 yang diterbitkan oleh Netherlands Vehicle Authority (RDW).\n\nGrup Perseroan dalam memproduksi ban selalu memegang teguh komitmennya, yaitu untuk mempertahankan dan meningkatkan mutu produk dengan mengikuti aturan dari lembaga-lembaga sertifikasi ban yang ada di Indonesia dan Internasional, serta memuaskan pelanggan dengan menciptakan produk yang terjamin, aman serta kompetitif.\n\nSaat ini Grup Perseroan memiliki 4 produk ban dalam untuk sepeda, sepeda motor, mobil dan truk, dan 28 produk ban luar untuk sepeda dan sepeda motor. Kingland adalah salah satu merek manufaktur di Indonesia sejak tahun 1977 yang berlokasi di Tangerang, Banten, Jawa Barat Indonesia.","history":{"amount":"97 B","board":"Papan Pengembangan","date":"8 May 2023","price":"138","registrar":"","shares":"700,000,000","underwriters":["Victoria Sekuritas Indonesia"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"18.41%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"33916896","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"HARDI MULIAWAN"}],"director":[{"id":"33916893","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"ANEKA WARNA"},{"id":"33916894","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"HABIBULLAH"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"33916897","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"DANNY SETIAWAN"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"33916895","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"INDRA MULIAWAN"}],"president_director":[{"id":"33916892","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2026-06-24T17:01:46+07:00","value":"HARRIS MULIAWAN"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"31.6%","name":"PT KINGLAND INVESTINDO NUSANTARA","value":"1.10 B","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"18.34%","name":"MASYARAKAT NON WARKAT","value":"638.19 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"0.07%","name":"MASYARAKAT WARKAT","value":"2.50 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""}],"subsidiary":[],"profile":{"fund_type":{"value":"","info":""},"inception_date":"","fund_manager":